<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gateway 2000.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gateway 2000.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds initiated coverage of Gateway 2000 Inc with an accumulate rating, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 7/8 at 53-3/4.</p>
